{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "436088cd-6d44-8bd2-8cb3-84199e09bb15",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:42:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:39:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I know this is silly, but I'm trying to figure out the trash thing. I'm on speakerphone, can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I hear you fine. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. So I have an old dishwasher, and I think it's, um, a big item? I don't know if it goes out with the regular trash or if somebody has to come get it separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:40:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a dishwasher. So appliances like that usually don't go out with the regular barrel. Is it hooked up still or is it already out of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's out. It's in the garage. I thought maybe I just put it by the curb, but then my sister said you need a sticker or something? Or that's for a different town, maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:40:23-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be a different town. Let me jot this down, large appliance, in the garage, no sticker yet. Generally for big items you call in and set up a pickup rather than just leaving it out. I'll have you check the city's trash page for the exact steps, though, or I can put you through to the solid waste folks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:40:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry, I'm looking at it now. I have my laptop, but the corner's cracked, so the screen is kind of weird on the left side. I can't tell if that's a menu or a different page."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:40:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, take your time. Look for something that says bulky items or large item pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry, there's a calendar. It says recycling and trash, but I don't know which one I am. Is that by street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's by your street, yeah. You'd normally put in your address. What's your regular trash day, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:41:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I think Thursday? But with today's rain, is that still Thursday? Or does it move?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:41:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rain by itself doesn't usually move it. If it gets bad tomorrow they'll put out a notice. So next pickup would be tomorrow, Thursday, if that's your day. Was it Thursday for trash and recycling both, or one of them every other week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, sorry, I thought both were weekly? Is recycling every other week? I'm really not sure now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be every other week, yeah. I'd check that calendar for the recycling week. Tell you what, I'll transfer you to solid waste, and they can confirm the dishwasher and your recycling week at the same time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry, yes please. I'm still not totally sure which one I'm supposed to be on, but that'd help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:42:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Hang on, I'm sending you over now."
    }
  ],
